        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kuwulajidwa kwa Ishibosheti",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ishibosheti, mwanace jwa Saulo, ali apikene kuti Abinele awilile ku Hebuloni, ŵajasile mtima, soni Aisalaeli wosope wakamwile woga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ishiboshetijo ŵakwete ŵandu ŵaŵili ŵiŵaliji ŵakulongolela makuga ga ngondo. Jumo ŵaliji lina lyakwe Baana, ni jwine ŵaliji Lekabu, wosopeŵa ŵaliji ŵanace ŵa Limoni, jwa lukosyo lwa Benjamini, jwa ku Beeloti (pakuŵa Beeloti jaliji mbali ja Benjamini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵandu ŵa ku Beeloti ŵatilile ku Gitaimu, aŵele ali mkutama nawo kweleko mpaka apano).",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.4.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yonatani, mwanace jwa Saulo, ŵakwete mwanace jwamlemale ngongolo, lina lyakwe Mefiboseti. Ŵaliji ni yaka msanope ndaŵi jijapikanice ngani ja ciwa ca Saulo ni Yonatani kutyocela ku Yesilele. Mundu juŵamlelaga mwanaceju piŵajipikene jele nganiji, mwacitemacitema ŵamnyakwile mwanacejo ni kutila najo. Ni pakutila mwakwanguya, mwanacejo ŵamkulupwice ni kugwila pasi, ni ŵawulele. Kulemala ni kwaliji kukoko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.9.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 9:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo Lekabu ni Baana, ŵanace ŵa Limoni, mundu jwa ku Bewoli jula, ŵawutandite ulendo wakuja ku nyumba ja Ishibosheti, ŵajile kwika ku nyumbako lyuŵa lili pa mtwe. Ndaŵi jeleji Ishibosheti ŵaliji mkupumula, lugono lwa musi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mlonda jwamkongwe, jwa pa mlango wa nyumbajo, ŵaliji mkupwagula tiligu, kaneko ni ŵatandite gwesela, ni ŵagonile. Myoyo Lekabu ni Baana ŵagambile kuti gwele, kwinjila m'nyumbamo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali ajinjile m'nyumbamo, ŵamsimene Ishiboshetijo ali agonile pa cindanda pakwe. Jemanjajo ŵamsomile ni lipanga, ni ali amwuleje ŵamkatile mtwe wakwe. Ŵawujigele mtwewo ni ŵajesile nawo cilo cosope, kupitila litala lya ku Ciŵata ca Yolodani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo ŵajawile nawo mtwe wa Ishiboshetiwo kwa Daudi",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ku Hebuloni. Ŵamsalile m'mwenyejo kuti, “Ŵalakwe mwenye, ngati awu mtwe wa Ishibosheti, mwanace jwa Saulo, m'magongo jwenu jula juŵasosagasosaga kwawulaga ŵalakwe jula. Lelo jino AMBUJE",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " amwucisye Saulo ni yisukulu yakwe ligongo lya ŵalakwe ambuje.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.4.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambo Daudi ŵamjanjile Lekabu ni mpwakwe Baana kuti, “Nditu ngulumbila pali AMBUJE ŵawukulupwisye umi wangu kwa amagongo ŵangu wosope, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ndaŵi jiŵayice mundu jwine kukusalila kuti Saulo awile, ŵaganisyaga kuti ayice kwa une ni utenga wambone, nambo une namkamwile, ni namwuleje ku Sikilagi. Jelejo ni jaliji mbote jiŵapocele ligongo lya utenga ŵakwewo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.1.1+2SA.1.2+2SA.1.3+2SA.1.4+2SA.1.5+2SA.1.6+2SA.1.7+2SA.1.8+2SA.1.9+2SA.1.10+2SA.1.11+2SA.1.12+2SA.1.13+2SA.1.14+2SA.1.15+2SA.1.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 1:1-16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ana tiyiciŵa yakogoya mwamtuli kwa ŵandu ŵakusakala ŵakuwulaga mundu jwangalemwa ali agonile m'nyumba mwakwe, ana ni komboleka une kumleka ngampa cilango jemanja, mpaka kumtyosya pa cilambo capasi pano, ligongo lya ciwa ca mundujo?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo Daudi ŵalamwile asilikali ŵakwe ŵa ngondo, ŵawuleje ŵanduwo, ni ŵakatile magasa ni sajo syawo, ni ŵakolece mungulugulu litanda lya ku Hebuloni. Nambo ŵawujigele mtwe wa Ishibosheti, ni ŵajile kuwusika mwilembe lya Abinele ku Hebuloni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.4.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
